  "title": "Intermex and Zeepay Announce Strategic Partnership to Expand Money Transfer Services to Africa",
  "summary": "MIAMI, Aug. 26, 2025 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- International Money Express, Inc. (NASDAQ: IMXI) (“Intermex” or the “Company”), a leading money remittance provider to Latin America and the Caribbean, today announced a new strategic partnership with Zeepay, a rapidly growing fintech focused on Africa.",
